/T (Bharatanatyam is much more than a dance form; it is a beautiful expression of Indian culture, history and tradition. Through its movements, mudras, expressions, music and storytelling, it allows dancers to communicate emotions and preserve stories passed down through generations. An Arangetram marks an important milestone in a dancer's journey, celebrating years of dedication, practice and learning. By understanding the different elements of this performance, audiences can develop a deeper appreciation for Bharatanatyam and the cultural heritage it represents.)
